  block+='The default Dockerfile currently pins Go 1.26.6 and has not been qualified by these measurements. Certification requires the tested Linux arm64/cgroup v2 / Go 1.27.1 runtime (CGO disabled), default Go scheduler/GC behavior, fixed RF policy (20 attempts / anchored 60 s / ClientIP, 2 global slots, 1 per-client slot, 60 s deadline, six Cells), experiment worker 1 / queue 16, and the exact pack hashes. W1 uses 120 rays / 400 m / both planning frequencies. W2 and valid heavier workloads have distinct certification boundaries; unbounded development, arbitrary datasets, untested W2 contention and API maxima are not covered. See the [complete profile matrix and evidence](./fixed-deployment-profile-certification.md). Auto remains observation-only, and no user resource settings or admission changes are added.\n\n'
